				<wikidot:authorName>Retian</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1950764</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This is the first thing I read in the series so I completely lost my shit when I realized the whole ghost ordeal was just the team tripping balls.<br /> I love the mental imagery of these threatening cyborgs going to a seance, snorting drugs after failing to get results, then scaring the crap out of everyone else while they fight an imaginary ghost with lasers and shit.</p> 
				 	]]>
