				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-12767505/death-perception#post-4421302</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Tue, 12 Nov 2019 14:55:26 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Raptie</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>1968091</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>It's so good to read another ARD-written Tau-5. There's this Pratchett/Adams-esque vibe to how you write them that is so distinctive and compelling.</p> <p>Like, you let their dialogue do all of the heavy lifting, and the prose is simple and elegant enough that it doesn't distract from the absurd dry humor that is basically everything they say.</p> <p>+1 so much, and thank you again for such characters.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
