					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-12767505#post-4410711</guid>
				<title>Authors Post</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-12767505/death-perception#post-4410711</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Thu, 31 Oct 2019 06:20:47 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>TyGently</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2038009</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <blockquote> <p><em>I am a man of no specific faith</em><br /> <em>I have no knowledge of beyond the grave</em><br /> <em>But I can't deny the dead don't always die</em><br /> <em>I have seen a ghost and it was no mistake</em><br /> <em>It was as clear as all the drinks I've drank</em><br /> <em>But I swear I was dry</em><br /> <em><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kC0chS71r4s">The dead don't always die</a></em></p> </blockquote> <p>The gang is back together for the first time since <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/samsara">Samsara</a>!</p> <p>Unlike in that tale, my main contributions here are structural and thematic. ARD did most of the actual work, but I wrote the part that includes the phrase &quot;ghost egg&quot;, so I think we're about even.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
