					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Coauthored with <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tygently" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2038009&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1572503155" alt="TyGently" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2038009)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tygently" >TyGently</a></span>.</p> <p>Special thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/vezaz" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1403034&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1572503155" alt="Vezaz" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1403034)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/vezaz" >Vezaz</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tawny0" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2244665&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1572503155" alt="tawny0" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2244665)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tawny0" >tawny0</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/greenwolf" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1814684&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1572503155" alt="GreenWolf" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1814684)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/greenwolf" >GreenWolf</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ch00bakka" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1238719&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1572503155" alt="ch00bakka" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1238719)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ch00bakka" >ch00bakka</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedantique" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3118444&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1572503155" alt="Pedantique" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3118444)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/pedantique" >Pedantique</a></span>, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rounderhouse" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4187885&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1572503155" alt="Rounderhouse" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4187885)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rounderhouse" >Rounderhouse</a></span> for their critique.</p> <p>I started writing this for last year's Halloween contest and then set it aside to work on <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/speed-demon-hub">Speed Demon</a>. Luckily, Ty helped me revive it with their fresh ideas and ideas to salvage my ideas. I had a lot of fun revisiting my cyborg murder-children for the first time in over three and a half years, and I hope you do too!</p> 
				 	]]>
